    "id": "9c7d550b758d9c8f",
    "title": "Anthropic、科学研究向けAIワークベンチ「Claude Science」を発表──NVIDIAのBioNeMoツールキットと連携",
    "original_title": "",
    "category": "AI",
    "source": "ITmedia AI+",
    "source_url": "",
    "published_at": "2026-07-01T00:54:25+00:00",
